          "text": "<h1><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Acute Care Mobile Experience</span></span></span></h1>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Stryker's Acute Care Mobile Experience is a full-length semi-trailer truck journeying across North American cities offering customers an opportunity to engage with our latest product and technology solutions in person. Check out the map below and download the schedule for more information. See you soon!</span></p>\n",
